# Backend API base URL, no trailing slash.
#
# In dev, Vite proxies /api to localhost:8000 (see vite.config.js) so this
# can stay empty. In production the management app is hosted separately
# from both the backend and the member frontend, so set this to the
# backend's public URL, e.g. https://elcoraldb.alz.name.ng
#
# Whatever origin this app is served from must also be listed in the
# backend's ADMIN_CORS_ORIGINS, or the browser will block every request.
VITE_API_URL=
